//
//   // Open it with EnterScriptedMenu: Init(), OnShow(), the cursor, the focus and a working Close()
//   // all come with it. ShowScriptedMenu is the wrong call for a gameplay menu: no cursor, and the
//   // clicks fall through to the world. EnterScriptedMenu returns NULL while another menu owns the
//   // stack (the chat input, an action, another mod's menu), so call this one frame after the key,
//   // chat command or RPC that wants the menu:
//   //     GetGame().GetCallQueue(CALL_CATEGORY_GUI).CallLater(MyMod_OpenFilterMenu, 100, false);
//   void MyMod_OpenFilterMenu()
